SUMMARY:Access Bars® Class
DESCRIPTION:Access Consciousness® Asheville\nYou must be present for the 
 entire class in order to be certified as a Bars Practitioner (BP).\n\nThe 
 first class in Access Consciousness is The Bars®. There are 32 points on 
 your head which\, when gently touched\, effortlessly and easily release an
 ything that doesn’t allow you to receive. It’s like hitting the delete
  button on your computer. All of the thoughts\, feelings\, and emotions th
 at keep you stuck\, that keep you repeating the same patterns in your life
  over and over again\, are released.\n\nDid you know there are 32 points o
 n your head which\, when gently touched\, effortlessly and easily release 
 anything that doesn’t allow you to receive? These points contain all the
  thoughts\, ideas\, beliefs\, emotions and considerations that you have st
 ored in any lifetime. This is an opportunity for you to let go of everythi
 ng!\n\nThousands of people have used Access Bars™ to change many aspects
  of their body and their life\, including sleep\, health and weight\, mone
 y\, sex and relationships\, anxiety\, stress and so much more. At worst yo
 u will feel like you have just had a phenomenal massage. At best your whol
 e life can change into something greater with total ease.\n\nRegistration:
  https://www.consciousbeing.institute/event-details/asheville-nc-access-ba
 rs-class-august-2026\n\nThe exact location will be determined closer to th
 e event date.
